dby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-18T14:45:15-08:00","id":1018914,"title":"","content":"Now, because Exalted, I could imagine a traveling Lunar circus with San beasts that accidentally sets up shop in Nexus's Harlotry district - you know, 'exotic entertainment' and all... and then the Lunar wondering why people suddenly show up to shag his animals, instead of just watch them perform - they're still offering to pay of course","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T01:39:55-08:00","id":1019133,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1015885-lunar-hustles?p=1018789#post1018789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But hey, <b>the circuses still exist today</b> - so the business model has to be working somehow</div> </div> </div> </div>Only just barely.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-19T03:20:05-08:00","id":1019146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/1015885-lunar-hustles?p=1018789#post1018789\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> No clue. But a traveling circus could also simply be the cover for moving around a large animal-based army, for a Lunar - so money wouldn't have to be the primary factor.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because armies are notorious as a historically cheap endeavour.<br /> <br /> Where does their food come from?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">But hey, the circuses still exist today - so the business model has to be working somehow</div> </div> </div> </div>Orchestras and opera and ballet still exist today.<br /> <br /> If somebody gets into orchestra or opera or ballet hoping to get rich, they're terribly na\u00efve.<br /> <br /> \u200bUnderstand that a thing making just enough money to still exist does not make it a successful business, and is not sustainable in the long run. A business that is barely in the black just needs one unexpected major expense, or just one decently long period of nobody paying for their services anymore, to go under.<br /> <br /> \u200bStill, this talk of a huge circus that goes around despite not making any money... this is supposed to be a thing that <i>avoids</i> attention?<br /> <br /> \u200bIt reminds me of one joke in the original version of The Office, where somebody is telling some nonsense story about how Bruce Lee is still alive and was secretly recruited to infiltrate Triads, and a character snarks about how your first choice for an undercover operative is the most famous film martial artist in the world.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}